+      COMMENTED OUT in balance_imu_state's cat (not deleted) -> obs 13 -> 9 dims, docstring updated.
+  (2) RENAME: reset_imu_sensor_model -> reset_imu_turnon_residuals everywhere (events.py func +
+      __all__, curriculums.py term lookups x2, observations.py comments, cfg registration) —
+      semantics: per-episode POST-CALIBRATION turn-on/initial bias residual + latency. The stds
+      should be set to the MEASURED residual spread, not the raw uncalibrated bias.
