+      _set_obs_noise_std would clobber the vector with a scalar.
+  (4) FINAL #8: custom PerChannelGaussianNoiseCfg (NoiseCfg subclass) + per_channel_gaussian_noise
+      in NEW mdp/stationary/noise.py; std as a PLAIN TUPLE -> clean !!python/tuple dump (parsers
