+      accepts float|tensor|tuple; dr_ramp call site lerps element-wise for tuples. dr_ramp can now
+      be active or wrapped with no crash and no clobbering in any std type.
+  (6) VERIFICATION: runtime check under the isaac sim python — func string resolves to a callable,
+      isinstance NoiseCfg, exact manager application path ran on a dummy tensor (zero channels stay
